   bottom: 20px;\n      color: #0e648b;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .footer .star { font-size: 27px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; }\n    .footer .page-no {\n      border: 2px solid #0e648b;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      height: 27px;\n      width: 27px;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-left: 4px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"topband\">\n      <div class=\"dots\"></div>\n      <div class=\"logo\">♨ 同步解析与测评</div>\n      <div class=\"book\">数学　五年级　下册</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>第 2 课时　第 1 课时练习课</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"columns\">\n      <section class=\"left\">\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <span class=\"num\">1.</span>填一填。<br>\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(1)　$\\frac34+\\frac25=$（　　）$+\\frac34$，应用了（　　）律。</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:43px; left:51px;\">$\\frac25$</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:65px; left:23px;\">加法交换</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(2)　$\\frac15+\\frac38+\\frac58=\\frac15+$（$\\frac38+\\frac58$），应用</div>\n          <div class=\"sub\">了（　　）律。</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:117px; left:27px;\">加法结合</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(3)$1-\\frac4{15}-\\frac7{15}=1-$（$\\frac4{15}+\\frac7{15}$），应用了</div>\n          <div class=\"sub\">（　　）律。</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:171px; left:31px;\">减法的性质</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <span class=\"num\">2.</span>在<span class=\"circle\">○</span>里填上适当的运算符号。<br>\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(1)$\\frac38+\\frac49+\\frac59=\\frac38+$（$\\frac49$ <span class=\"circle\">○</span> $\\frac59$）</div>\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(2)$\\frac38+\\frac49-\\frac49=\\frac38+$（$\\frac49$ <span class=\"circle\">○</span> $\\frac49$）</div>\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(3)$\\frac87-\\frac59-\\frac49=\\frac87-$（$\\frac59$ <span class=\"circle\">○</span> $\\frac49$）</div>\n          <div class=\"sub formula\">(4)$\\frac87-\\frac49+\\frac49=\\frac87-$（$\\frac49$ <span class=\"circle\">○</span> $\\frac49$）</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:40px; left:176px;\">＋</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:75px; left:176px;\">－</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:110px; left:176px;\">＋</div>\n          <div class=\"answerword\" style=\"top:145px; left:176px;\">－</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <span class=\"num\">3.</span>选择合适的方法进行计算。\n          <div class=\"calc-grid\">\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$\\frac34+\\frac13+\\frac56$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac34+\\frac12$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac54$</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$\\frac58+\\left(\\frac34-\\frac16\\right)$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac58+\\frac7{12}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac{15}{24}+\\frac{14}{24}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac{29}{24}$</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$\\frac23-\\left(\\frac56-\\frac5{20}\\right)$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac23-\\left(\\frac{20}{24}-\\frac{6}{24}\\right)$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac{16}{24}-\\frac{14}{24}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac1{12}$</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$\\frac9{12}-\\frac17+\\frac59$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac9{12}+\\frac59-\\frac17$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac{?}{?}$</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$1-\\frac34-\\frac1{20}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $1-\\left(\\frac{15}{20}+\\frac1{20}\\right)$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $1-\\frac{16}{20}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $\\frac4{20}=\\frac15$</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"calc\">\n              <div>$\\frac58+\\frac57+\\frac38-\\frac8{14}$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand small\">= $(\\frac58+\\frac38)+(\\frac57-\\frac8{14})$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $1+\\frac17$</div>\n              <div class=\"hand\">= $1\\frac17$</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"right\">\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <span class=\"num\">4.</span>计算下面图形的周长。\n          <div class=\"geometry\">\n            <div class=\"shape1\">\n              <div class=\"top\"></div><div class=\"bottom\"></div><div class=\"sidea\"></div><div class=\"sideb\"></div>\n              <span class=\"a\">3 dm</span>\n              <span class=\"b\">10 dm</span>\n              <span class=\"c\">4 dm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"shape2\">\n              <span class=\"toplabel\">[illegible]</span>\n              <span class=\"bottomlabel\">12 m</span>\n              <span class=\"rightlabel\">8<br>cm</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"red-marks\">\n            ①　$\\frac12+\\frac43+\\frac{10}{6}$<br>\n            $=\\frac5{10}+\\frac{10}{6}$<br>\n            $=\\frac{?}{?}$ dm\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"red-marks\" style=\"position:absolute; top:70px; right:2px;\">\n            ②　$\\frac7{12}+\\frac{12}{?}+\\frac83$<br>\n            $=\\frac{?}{?}+\\frac{?}{?}$<br>\n            $=10$ cm\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"wordproblem\">\n          <span class=\"num\">5.</span>周末，五(1)班有$\\frac17$的同学到郊外劳动，有<br>\n          $\\frac25$的同学到图书馆读书，还有$\\frac1{35}$的同学留<br>\n          在家中。留在家中的同学比出门的同学<br>\n          多还是少？多或少几分之几？\n          <div class=\"red-work\">\n            $\\frac17+\\frac25=\\frac5{35}+\\frac{14}{35}=\\frac{19}{35}$<br>\n            $\\frac{19}{35}-\\frac1{35}=\\frac{18}{35}$\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"wordproblem\" style=\"margin-top:25px;\">\n          <span class=\"num\">6.</span>有一个装满水的水池，若第一次放出一池<br>\n          水的$\\frac38$，第二次放出一池水的$\\frac14$，第三次又<br>\n          注入一池水的$\\frac49$。现在池子里的水占池子<br>\n          的几分之几？\n          <div class=\"red-work\" style=\"font-size:22px; margin-top:15px;\">\n            $1-\\frac38-\\frac14+\\frac49=\\frac{59}{72}$\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">[淡色背景图案]</div>\n    <div class=\"footer\"><span class=\"star\">✣</span><span class=\"page-no\">72</span></div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
